{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13105020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13105020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1310502001:0":{"text":"あそこは第一次神魔大戦の戦場だった、故に多くの勇士の骸が埋まっている。","source_cn":"那里曾是恶魔战争的一处战场，有许多勇士埋骨泥下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E904D6975032812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1310502002:0":{"text":"そして戦いが終わった後、あの地は一年中花が咲き続けるようになった。","source_cn":"战争结束后，那里突然长满了鲜花，即便冬季也从不衰败。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47752C90950E891B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310502003:0":{"text":"もしかしたら、本当に英雄の魂が花に宿っているのかも……","source_cn":"或许真有英雄的灵魂寄托在那些花中吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EEA9231301716C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"フェルガルド","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}